==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 2

==Battleground==
*1 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*4 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] to deal with the Elizabeth the LVIth. Awakened Bahamut should easily take care of the Otters that spawn in the stage.

